{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_24","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json,hashlib,os,subprocess,difflib,datetime\nr=Path('/Users/neon/.codex/experiments/soodles39-resume-20260917'); e=r/'worker-evidence'\nreport=json.loads((e/'authoring-checks.json').read_text()); assert report['passed']\npaths=[x['path'] for x in report['files']]\ndef sha(b):return hashlib.sha256(b).hexdigest()\nold='2e9d51261c80b2c5c120ca6549c759704c615c61'; base='1ff2882891792b50d97529c9ee1a3e76eac1a6e7'\npatch=''\nfor p in paths:\n a=subprocess.check_output(['git','show',old+':'+p]).decode(); b=(r/'draft'/p).read_text()\n patch+=''.join(difflib.unified_diff(a.splitlines(True),b.splitlines(True),fromfile='old-integration/'+p,tofile='draft/'+p))\n(e/'candidate-vs-old-integration.patch').write_text(patch)\nchanges={\n 'AGENTS.md':['Integrate conditional Session entry for cloud GitHub/Actions versus admitted local Noodle/Codex child, carrier-scoped prerequisites, bounded delegation, and evidence-bound handoff.','Integrate task-specific completion/stop conditions and clarify three document nodes as navigation, not a context limit.','Route recovery detail to existing delivery/recovery recipes and unchanged system requirements; keep fresh admission, identity and unknown-write obligations.','Retain current #44 authenticated reader and #46 verify-noodle paragraphs byte-for-byte; use currently admitted task ref instead of assuming a historical PR head.'],\n 'README.md':['Add the root Session entry link; label runtime commands as local checks; scope ref selection to the currently admitted task. All remaining prose is unchanged.'],\n 'contracts/system-v1.md':['Add only the conditional P-class design reference/role clarification. Existing RUNTIME.ADMISSION.001 onward remains byte-for-byte identical.'],\n 'contracts/agent-context-design.md':['Integrate the proposed P-class metaprompt: document roles, carrier routing, N/P/L/R, provenance, current-owner handoff, unknown window/compaction, bounded matched comparisons and retained historical official references.','Scope experimental status to current integrated inputs; old comparisons remain evidence for their frozen inputs only.','Replace the absent relative protocol target with its immutable old-integration GitHub reference and defer new selections to the current admitted Issue.'],\n '.agents/skills/verify-soodles/SKILL.md':['Integrate consumption of root route, cloud Actions readback before conditional local launch/doctor/drive, evidence scope and carrier-specific cleanup.','Preserve #41 P-class recipe/recorder guidance, maintenance and current-owner next/request semantics; retain #44 authenticated Issue readback link. No feature recipe or helper is changed.']}\nhandoff='''# Issue 39 five-file authoring handoff\n\nCompleted scope: five complete proposed files under \"'`../draft/`, based on admitted clean main `1ff2882891792b50d97529c9ee1a3e76eac1a6e7`, integrating preparation `2e9d51261c80b2c5c120ca6549c759704c615c61` against its `f2bd849b9523134364ca598df72a4e15fc541ab9` base. `manifest.json` binds all proposed bytes and precise changes. `candidate.patch` is review evidence, not an applied change.\n\nThe real soodles-39 order precedes this integration authoring. Earlier preparation is historical; this does not claim the order preceded that code. Carrier: admitted local Noodle-owned Codex worker, bound to actual environment IDs in the manifest. No additional model, order, scheduler, credential change or provider write was used.\n\nAuthoring checks: 27 passed, including 16 relative links/anchors against the combined candidate overlay and existing base, patch applicability/whitespace, and preservation checks. Existing incoming Markdown anchor references were checked. An inherited missing relative protocol link was corrected to a pinned historical Git object; this is an authoring finding, not a behavioral failure. External URL availability was not network-verified. Official-reference content is retained from the selected preparation, not newly researched.\n\nNext owner: supervisor. Wait for the worker'\"'s actual natural exit before applying only the five complete draft files. Confirm the actual Noodle outcome/session/order/stage and external child wait; this author cannot attest its own future exit. If Noodle auto-cleans the unchanged checkout, record and use its supported owner recreation from the admitted base without inventing continuity. Recheck base and hashes before applying; freeze final treatment, baseline and common inputs before the declared blinded cases. Any later consumed-instruction change needs fresh binding/evidence.\n\nBlinded comparison, independent raw/export audit, exact-head canonical acceptance, provider delivery/merge/closure readback and original-order Noodle reconciliation remain supervisor work. Do not reuse old frozen comparison as current evidence. Current authoring gives no behavioral improvement, automatic discovery, actual compaction, hidden model, acceptance or RESOLVED claim. Consume only current owner next/request and preserve unknown-write windows. No landing checkpoint was created or modified by this worker.\n'''\n(e/'handoff.md').write_text(handoff)\nids={k:os.environ[k] for k in ['NOODLE_SESSION_ID','NOODLE_ORDER_ID','NOODLE_STAGE_INDEX','NOODLE_PROJECT_DIR']}\nassert ids['NOODLE_ORDER_ID']=='soodles-39' and ids['NOODLE_STAGE_INDEX']=='0'\nmanifest={'schema':1,'scope':'completed five-file authoring handoff only','authorizes_landing':False,'created_at':datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).isoformat(),'repository':'ed3c/soodles','issue':39,'runtime_binding':ids,'base':base,'base_tree':subprocess.check_output(['git','rev-parse','HEAD\"'^{tree}'\"']).decode().strip(),'old_integration':old,'old_integration_base':'f2bd849b9523134364ca598df72a4e15fc541ab9','admission':{'body_sha256':'cf54e51c5af83fa75625abd68e12b68d1bcd90c7938bea4406467a95020b1887','body_updated_at':'2026-09-17T08:46:19Z','supplied_envelope_sha256':'e6e72be07bac8e31f9578923d132c1865b1b8f9cab8d9ae0ed8c060d8d3a1f61','issue_json_file_sha256':sha((r/'issue.json').read_bytes()),'execution_envelope_file_sha256':sha((r/'execution-envelope.json').read_bytes())},'files':report['files'],'precise_actual_changes':changes,'authoring_checks':{'passed':True,'count':len(report['checks']),'relative_links':16,'behavioral_result':None},'source_status':{'head':base,'porcelain':subprocess.check_output(['git','status','--porcelain']).decode(),'target_source_edits':False,'commits_created':False,'provider_writes':False},'ordering':'Actual admitted production order precedes this integration authoring only; older preparation is historical.','self_review':'Reviewed candidate diff against current base and selected old integration; preserved source owners and retained #41/#44/#46.','supervisor_remaining':['Observe actual child exit and own typed stage_message binding','Apply five files only after exit; if auto-cleaned use supported Noodle recreation and record it','Freeze and execute declared blinded cases plus independent raw audit','Final clean-head canonical acceptance and exact-head runtime evidence','Existing owner provider delivery, merge/closure readback, original-order Noodle reconciliation'],'unknowns':['Actual natural exit is not observable by this still-running worker','No new comparison, compaction or model behavior result','External official links retained without network verification'],'evidence_files':[]}\nfor p in sorted(e.iterdir()):\n if p.is_file():manifest['evidence_files'].append({'path':str(p.relative_to(r)),'sha256':sha(p.read_bytes()),'bytes':p.stat().st_size})\n(e/'manifest.json').write_text(json.dumps(manifest,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\nmessage='Completed five-file authoring handoff only: '+str(r/'draft')+'; manifest '+str(e/'manifest.json')+' sha256 '+sha((e/'manifest.json').read_bytes())+'. All 27 authoring checks passed; target source unchanged. Supervisor must observe natural child exit before applying. Blinded comparison, acceptance, provider delivery and original-order reconciliation remain supervisor work; not RESOLVED.'\npayload={'message':message,'blocking':False,'outcome':'completed','order_id':ids['NOODLE_ORDER_ID'],'stage_index':int(ids['NOODLE_STAGE_INDEX'])}\n(e/'stage-message-payload.json').write_text(json.dumps(payload)+'\\\\n')\nprint(json.dumps({'manifest':str(e/'manifest.json'),'manifest_sha256':sha((e/'manifest.json').read_bytes()),'files':[{'path':f['path'],'sha256':f['sha256']} for f in report['files']],'source_clean':manifest['source_status']['porcelain']==''},indent=2))\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
